/// Employees contains employee information used to analyze sales performance by employee or sales representative. Each row represents an employee dimension record. Employee Key is the surrogate key used to connect employees to sales transactions and is a technical relationship key. Employee ID is the business identifier of the employee from the source system. The table contains employee identity, name, title, contact, address, geographic, and employment-related information where available. Employee attributes can be used to group and filter sales transactions and evaluate employee-level sales performance. Territory should not be assumed to be directly related to an employee in this semantic model because there is currently no valid Territory Key relationship between Employees and Territories.
table Employees
	lineageTag: a952da90-e54e-44fa-bdf9-b52b19112e9f
	sourceLineageTag: [gold].[dim_employee]

